thug2-web - licensing

This repository contains two kinds of material.

1. Tables of the original game (no licence granted)

   port/src/hook/exe_data.cpp and port/src/hook/member_tables.inc rebuild tables of the original THUG2.exe (their
   addresses, names and checksums) from the reconstructed game code of the THUG2 decompilation (upstream/). Like that
   code, they belong to the game's owners, and no licence of any kind is granted for them. See NOTICE.md.

2. Original work (MIT licence)

   Everything else written for this project - the web platform layer (port/), the page and the local server (web/),
   the tools (port/tools/) and the documentation (docs/) - is licensed under the MIT licence
   below.

   The decompilation (upstream/, a git submodule) has its own terms: upstream/LICENSE and upstream/NOTICE.md.
   Third-party sources the build downloads (port/tools/fetch_deps.sh) keep their own licences.

